{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026QDWgHld89c1793261379.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>行政長官李家超下午公開宏福苑大火獨立委員會報告，及交代跟進工作。勞工及福利局局長孫玉菡表示，獨立委員會運作期間，勞工處竭盡所能提供資料。針對吸煙而引起的地盤火警，勞工處已經修訂法例，從今年7月開始，全面禁止地盤內吸煙，委員會也建議促使承建商承擔起法定責任，勞工處已經落實。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T08:42:02.611139+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T07:58:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T08:58:16.329742+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T08:38:23.125923+00:00","content_hash":"c615055eb4717ee8aefddb94bdaf0053394d4bcbb81c41f8d76986a381089ba7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T08:42:02.611139+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}